OL,3,GNEWSAFamily tributes to 'amazing'
OL,4,Acyclists killed in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe families of two cyclists who died
OL,7,Fin a fatal car crash have described
OL,8,Fthem as "amazing" people.
OL,10,FSteven Anscomb, 60, and Natasha Lewis,
OL,11,F51, died at the scene of the crash near
OL,12,FGravesend, Kent, on Sunday.
OL,14,FAnscomb's wife Fiona and daughters
OL,15,FLiberty and Imogen said in a statement:
OL,16,F"He will be so very deeply missed by so
OL,17,Fmany and has been robbed of the special
OL,18,Ftimes of life."
OL,20,FLewis's daughter Hermione said: "No
OL,21,Fwords can describe what an amazing,
OL,22,Fthoughtful, and strong woman she was."
